guide aurum-druid/dalaran-finale
title 30 - City of Dalaran: Defender of Dalaran
faction Alliance
race NightElf
class Druid
levels 30-30
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
category Dungeons
folder Aurum - Druid and dungeons
version 4

step Southshore at level 30
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip An Alarming Request is a level-30 breadcrumb. A lower-level friend should not expect Emissary Jacques to offer it. Bring the Stormwind quests from the earlier pickup chapter before travelling north.
  level 30

step Emissary Jacques
  getfp "Southshore" npc 2432
  accept 92432 lvl 30

step Modera outside Dalaran
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Travel north-west from Southshore, past Hillsbrad Fields toward Dalaran and Lordamere Lake. Avoid Tarren Mill and enemy camps. Find Modera by the outer sewer approach. Silverpine has no Alliance flight point here; do not go to the Sepulcher's Horde flight master.
  turnin 92432
  accept 92457 lvl 24 group 5
  accept 92458 lvl 24 group 5

step Enter City of Dalaran
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Meet your party at the sewer entrance. Keep the key supplied with Heart of Disruption, open the gate, and follow the large pipe to the portal. Alliance city access to the sewers is beside Cantrips and Crows. Check all four dungeon quests are accepted before the first pull.
  goto 8.5,59.2 "City of Dalaran entrance approach" live r 25

step Complete the dungeon
  tip Gather the blossom in the central garden for Shylamiir, finish Modera's remnants and Andromath's named objective, and collect the Arcane Mote at the Violet Citadel end of the run. Check all four quest entries before leaving.
  complete 92456 group 5
  complete 92489 group 5
  complete 92457 group 5
  complete 92458 group 5

step Claim Defender of Dalaran
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Return to Modera. For Heart of Disruption, choose Defender of Dalaran; it is a quest reward choice, not a random boss drop.
  turnin 92457
  turnin 92458 choose 279841

step Finish the Kirin Tor introduction
  tip Take Modera's follow-up and speak to Archmage Celindra in the Violet Citadel. Keep the supplied Arcane Mote through this handoff.
  accept 92459 lvl 24
  turnin 92459

step Return via Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Return by the same lakeshore and Hillsbrad route to Southshore, then fly to Stormwind for the final two rewards. Do not take Horde flight paths.
  fly "Stormwind"

step Stormwind: finish the other hand-ins
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 92456
  turnin 92489
  turnin 563 -- Finish Farrens reassignment report at Major Samuelson in Stormwind Keep after the Dalaran return.

step Beta test complete
  note Your tested route ends here. Save the Recorder session with /reload or logout, and record any wrong giver, gate, position or timing before revising the pack.
